{"id":"23ed499f8d7c6524","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-conservativity-proof.md","title":"保守性与两种模型扩张判据","display":"df-conservativity-proof — 保守性与两种模型扩张判据","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-conservativity-proof","aliases":["91-df-conservativity-proof","91-df-conservative-proof","91-df-conservativity-argument"],"display":"df-conservativity-proof — 保守性与两种模型扩张判据","depends_on":["[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","[[91-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-conservativity-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-conservativity-proof</span><span>91-df-conservative-proof</span><span>91-df-conservativity-argument</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-conservativity-proof — 保守性与两种模型扩张判据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8e718c83a9cc331\" href=\"?note=c8e718c83a9cc331\" title=\"91-df-structure\">91-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,S)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a> 的旧语言后果保守性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq U\">\\(S\\subseteq U\\)</span> 是经典一阶理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0=\\operatorname{Lang}(S)\\subseteq\\mathcal L_U\">\\(\\mathcal L_0=\\operatorname{Lang}(S)\\subseteq\\mathcal L_U\\)</span>；两者使用同一个旧语言。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(S)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preccurlyeq\">\\(\\preccurlyeq\\)</span> 分别为模型类与初等扩张关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModelExp}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModelExp}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElemExp}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElemExp}\\)</span> 是本节点定义的元理论性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conservativity\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ModelExp}(U/S)\\coloneqq\\forall\\mathcal M\\models S\\;\n\\exists\\mathcal N\\models U\\;(\\mathcal N\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathcal M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conservativity\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ModelExp}(U/S)\\coloneqq\\forall\\mathcal M\\models S\\;\n\\exists\\mathcal N\\models U\\;(\\mathcal N\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathcal M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElemExp}(U/S)\\coloneqq\\forall\\mathcal M\\models S\\;\n\\exists\\mathcal N\\models U\\;(\\mathcal M\\preccurlyeq\\mathcal N\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ElemExp}(U/S)\\coloneqq\\forall\\mathcal M\\models S\\;\n\\exists\\mathcal N\\models U\\;(\\mathcal M\\preccurlyeq\\mathcal N\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModelExp}(U/S)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{ElemExp}(U/S),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ElemExp}(U/S)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ModelExp}(U/S)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{ElemExp}(U/S),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ElemExp}(U/S)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原域扩张是初等扩张的特例，故第一蕴涵成立。由初等扩张推出保守性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\nvdash\\varphi\">\\(S\\nvdash\\varphi\\)</span>，完备性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\models S+\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal M\\models S+\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>；取所述初等扩张及其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 扩张，仍有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\nvdash\\varphi\">\\(U\\nvdash\\varphi\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>反向使用紧致性。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\models S\">\\(\\mathcal M\\models S\\)</span>，为每个元素加入新常量，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElDiag}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\operatorname{ElDiag}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span> 为在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> 中为真的全部旧语言含这些常量的句子。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\cup\\operatorname{ElDiag}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(U\\cup\\operatorname{ElDiag}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span> 不一致，有限个图示句的合取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta(\\vec c)\">\\(\\delta(\\vec c)\\)</span> 已与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 矛盾。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec c\">\\(\\vec c\\)</span> 不出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 中，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\vdash\\neg\\exists\\vec x\\,\\delta(\\vec x)\">\\(U\\vdash\\neg\\exists\\vec x\\,\\delta(\\vec x)\\)</span>。这是旧语言句，保守性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\neg\\exists\\vec x\\,\\delta(\\vec x)\">\\(S\\vdash\\neg\\exists\\vec x\\,\\delta(\\vec x)\\)</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\models\\delta(\\vec c)\">\\(\\mathcal M\\models\\delta(\\vec c)\\)</span> 冲突。因此紧致性产生 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的模型，其旧语言约化含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> 的初等嵌入；取同构副本可使该嵌入成为包含映射，即得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElemExp}(U/S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ElemExp}(U/S)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElemExp}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElemExp}\\)</span> 与句子保守性等价，不能说它严格更强。原书 Definition 8.6 的 model-conservative 是原域扩张条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModelExp}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModelExp}\\)</span>；Theorem 8.24 给出的 CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^-\">\\(^-\\)</span> 是保守而不满足原域扩张的实例。全归纳 UTB 的保守性也不直接保证每个 PA 模型的原域真理扩张。\nTB、UTB 的原书保守性证明用有限公理集的可定义部分真理解释：有限证明只用有限多标准公式，以算术谓词替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 后，出现的归纳仍是 PA 归纳。CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^-\">\\(^-\\)</span> 则使用其专门的保守性证明，不把这两种证明混用。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 7.5 的证明；Theorem 8.5、Definition 8.6、Theorem 8.24，印刷页 55–56、68–69、85，PDF 页 66–67、79–80、96。初等扩张等价刻画为此处补出的通常一阶紧致性论证，并非冒称原书编号定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c8e718c83a9cc331","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,S)$ 采用 [[91-df-conservative-truth]] 的旧语言后果保守性。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,S)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0=\\operatorname{Lang}(S)\\subseteq\\mathcal L_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mod}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\preccurlyeq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModelExp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElemExp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conservativity\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{ModelExp}(U/S)\\coloneqq\\forall\\mathcal M\\models S\\;\n\\exists\\mathcal N\\models U\\;(\\mathcal N\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathcal M).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElemExp}(U/S)\\coloneqq\\forall\\mathcal M\\models S\\;\n\\exists\\mathcal N\\models U\\;(\\mathcal M\\preccurlyeq\\mathcal N\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModelExp}(U/S)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{ElemExp}(U/S),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ElemExp}(U/S)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,S).","display":true},{"tex":"S\\nvdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M\\models S+\\neg\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"U\\nvdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M\\models S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ElDiag}(\\mathcal M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"U\\cup\\operatorname{ElDiag}(\\mathcal M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta(\\vec c)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec c","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"U\\vdash\\neg\\exists\\vec x\\,\\delta(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash\\neg\\exists\\vec x\\,\\delta(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M\\models\\delta(\\vec c)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElemExp}(U/S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElemExp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModelExp}","display":false},{"tex":"^-","display":false},{"te